    "description": {
      "value": "This cute and unassuming dragon toy activates once a creature moves into its square. It then unleashes a rapid burst of toxic gas in a 10-foot emanation. Those within the emanation when the snare is activated must attempt a DC 25 Fortitude saving throw or take 3d6 poison damage.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and is sickened 1.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage and is sickened 2."
